  "notes": "Hand-curated canonical event map for the Predictos event-odds feed (scoping plan 2026-10-29, section 1). Each slot is defined by Gamma search terms + question regex patterns. NO market slugs are hardcoded: markets are discovered at run time via Gamma /public-search and the Gamma /markets bulk scan (same endpoints/params as src/fetcher.py), then matched to a slot by pattern. A slot with no qualifying market on the day is logged as missing with a reason -- missing is a value, never filled with a proxy (plan section 1.1). Slots are evaluated in file order; a market claimed by an earlier slot is not re-claimed by a later one (one primary per event, plan section 1.3). Monthly review: add/retire slots here, never in code.",
